spans.s:
वि-√ घट् (often confounded with वि-√ घट्ट्) Ā. -घटते, to go or fly apart, become separate, disperse, Kāv.;
to be broken or interrupted or marred or frustrated or destroyed, Rājat.; Hit. :
Caus. -घटयति, to tear or rend asunder, separate, disperse, Prab.; Hit.;
to mar, frustrate, annihilate, destroy, Mṛcch.; Rājat.

वि-√ घट्ट् (cf. वि-√ घट्) Ā. -घट्टते, to smash or break to pieces, Prasannar.;
 P. -घट्टयति, to strike or force asunder, open (a door), sever, disperse, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to shake, stir, rub against, ib.; Suśr.
